{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'Is that Mr. Sandwich's plan, capitalism-based domination?'","created_at":"2021-08-18T19:54:13.388000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877641558709637171","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Nah, that'd be that other guy at the congress. Though that one probably could use some competition.\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T19:54:42.443000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877641680575135775","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'Yeah... I didn't quite understand all, or, well, really very much of that, but it... didn't sound good from what I could get.'","created_at":"2021-08-18T19:55:34.624000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877641899438112798","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Yeah, fingers crossed Finn's idea beats that, and then if needed all the rough parts get ironed out.\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T19:58:17.782000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877642583772385330","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'I hope so. I... want to be able to just... live here in peace once this war is over.' she laughs again, silent yet clearly strangely bitter. 'If I told my past self about that hope, she wouldn't believe me.'","created_at":"2021-08-18T20:01:03.851000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877643280316243988","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Well, that just means your present self has grown from that. Anyway, I hope Finn and Viv didn't drill you too much over at the park. Kuk only told me you didn't want to share any details for the time, so I didn't ask.\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T20:03:43.431000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877643949643284480","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'A-ah. Thanks. They were helping. Don't worry.' she looks somewhat flushed, and as if she wants to say more.","created_at":"2021-08-18T20:05:02.199000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877644280020217877","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Was it about your memories?\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T20:07:04.538000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877644793147183144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'Partially. I...' her voice breaks slightly, and her words start spilling out. 'Mender shot a gun into his hand, I panicked, apparently it was to test something, I was worried about him, then he wanted me to shoot one, I froze up a bit but he said it'd help me understand, so I did, reluctantly, he was alright and apparently just made of water and kelp, but the bullet hit a tree and it would have caused more damage to remove it, so I didn't, but I felt bad about it, and it sparked m-memories...'","created_at":"2021-08-18T20:09:19.736000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877645360208691260","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"Mender. Shot a gun into his hand. Well, I suppose he knows himself best to try crazy stuff like that.\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T20:10:08.881000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877645566337753098","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"she nods and continues. '...I went to sit by my memorial and they showed up, I asked them if they'd forgive 'a stranger' in my situation, then asked how to forgive myself for forgetting her, and I think Vivica put the pieces together but they were both so nice about it, and...' her voice trails off as she chokes back tears.","created_at":"2021-08-18T20:11:36.116000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877645932227874846","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"\"I thought that might be the case. That's why I didn't go after them when they asked where you were and that they wanted to talk with you. I think you needed to hear that reassurance from someone other than me as well.\"","created_at":"2021-08-18T20:12:55.270000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877646264223817728","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Cruithne","id":"150319814836092928","is_bot":0,"username":"cruithne"},"author_id":"150319814836092928","channel_id":"863470940183724082","content":"'...I think I did too. N-not that your reassurance isn't appreciated! It very much is. I just... needed to talk to someone else, and...' her voice quietens a little, 'ask for advice I couldn't really ask you.'","created_at":"2021-08-18T20:14:15.145000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"877646599243841536","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
